{
  "abstract": "We report the observation of a spin 4 resonance from the analysis of the reaction \u03c0 \u2212 p\u2192 K + K \u2212 n. The mass and width of the h-meson were determined to be 2050 MeV and 225 MeV. The quantum numbers are J P = 4 + , C = +1 and very probably I G = 0 + .",
